-- SBTF System — demonstration / development dataset (ANONYMISED)
-- Municipality of Mabini, Batangas — Franchising and Tricycle Driver
-- Registration System
--
-- !!! DEVELOPMENT ONLY !!!
-- This file creates synthetic accounts and records. It contains no real
-- personal information. Do NOT run it against the production project.
--
-- Applied automatically by:  supabase db reset
-- Applied manually by    :  psql "$DATABASE_URL" -f supabase/seed.sql
--
-- Generated by scripts/generate_seed.py — edit the generator, not the output.
